BRL-CAD maintains and uses a number of external libraries and tools critical
to its functionality that are not installed with the distribution. Generally
these are used either in various stages of the compilation process or as
maintenance tools.

brlinst is a standalone C++17 Windows installer generator, with EXE and native
Windows MSI backends. Configure misc/tools/brlinst separately to build it;
brlinst/README.adoc documents dependencies, tests, and the optional CPack hook.

